<ol><li>Open Terminal on your Mac running the macOS 27 beta.</li><br/>
<li>Input the following command at the prompt and press Enter: <strong>sudo defaults write "/Library/Preferences/FeatureFlags/Domain/GenerativeModels.plist" "EnhancedSiriWaitlist" -dict-add Enabled -bool NO</strong></li><br/>
